Cara and Ann are a consecutive block, and Elif then Gus must both come before Ann, so the block starts at slot 3: Elif, Gus, Cara, Ann. Dev must be at least three slots from both Cara and Ann and still leave room for both Ben and Hana after him, so Dev is slot 7. The two slots after Dev are Ben and Hana; exactly one slot between Finn and Ben, with Finn after Gus and Ben after Dev, places Finn in 6 and Ben in 8, so Hana is 9 and Ivo is 5.

